msgstr "Mirror into a table (optional)"

#: templates/designer/query.html:29
msgid ""
"Gespiegelte Daten stehen wie jede andere Tabelle für Listen, Diagramme, "
"Skripte und die API bereit."
msgstr ""
"Mirrored data is available for lists, charts, scripts and the API like any "
"other table."

#: templates/designer/query.html:37 templates/designer/script.html:38
